# The NNUE weights are committed so that a clone can build an app that plays chess
# without going near the network — that is the whole point of the thing. The big net is
# 104 MiB, past GitHub's 100 MiB hard limit for a blob, so LFS carries both of them.
# A clone therefore needs `git lfs install` before the files arrive as files.
Resources/Nets/*.nnue filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
